# The base calls a handset (an incoming call): it rings, answers, and the
# base hangs up. Identities are made up.
hold 80 a8 03 11 22 33 44

# Our {CC-SETUP}, addressed to that identity.
setup 80 a8 03 11 22 33 44
fp 03 05 05 07 80 a8 03 11 22 33 44 06 05 00 01 23 45 60 e0 40 e4 41

# {CC-ALERTING} and {CC-CONNECT} from the handset: TI flag set (it is the
# destination side), value 0.
pp 83 01
pp 83 07
fp 03 0f

# We release: {CC-RELEASE}; the handset completes it.
release
fp 03 4d
pp 83 5a
